<view class="wrap"><view class="eyebrow">记录吃掉的，也看见浪费的</view><view class="title">冰箱周报</view><view class="period"><button class="{{days===7?'':'secondary'}}" data-days="7" bindtap="period" disabled="{{loading}}">近 7 天</button><button class="{{days===30?'':'secondary'}}" data-days="30" bindtap="period" disabled="{{loading}}">近 30 天</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="refresh">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="detail">正在整理记录…</view><block wx:if="{{report}}"><view class="detail">{{report.from}} 至 {{report.to}}</view><view wx:if="{{report.partial}}" class="notice">这段时间的历史记录不完整，以下只统计已有记录。</view><view class="panel"><view wx:for="{{totals}}" wx:key="name" class="entry"><view class="heading"><view>{{item.name}}</view><text wx:if="{{item.count!==null}}" class="badge">{{item.count}} 次</text></view><view class="quantity">{{item.text}}</view></view></view><view class="section-title">每天的记录</view><view class="panel"><view wx:for="{{daily}}" wx:key="date" class="entry"><view>{{item.date}}</view><view class="detail">{{item.text}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!daily.length}}" class="detail">还没有操作记录，添加或消耗食材后这里会出现统计。</view></view><view class="detail">{{report.note}}</view><view class="detail">{{report.amountReason}}</view></block></view>
